  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "certificate",
      "title": "Server-token setup",
      "items": [
        "The operator uploads the server’s public certificate to the Apple management portal and imports the encrypted .p7m server token.",
        "The dep client uses the resulting OAuth 1.0a credentials; this token is unrelated to an MDM push certificate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Recurring reconciliation",
      "items": [
        "Inventory starts with a full fetch, then follows incremental cursors. Expired, invalid or missing cursors restart a full fetch; only a completed fetch reconciles devices absent from that generation.",
        "The server schedules synchronization and assignment independently. Assignment persists current-target outcomes and retry times, and readback verifies Apple state. Assignment does not complete device enrollment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "warning",
      "title": "Retry and concurrency",
      "items": [
        "HTTP throttling and per-device THROTTLED results are separate. Assignment honors retry_after_seconds and retains deferred work in durable assignment state.",
        "Each inventory page and its cursor commit together. Revision checks reject stale worker writes; partial snapshots never delete unseen devices."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
